        "explanation": "Confirm the cause, highest severity, recovery and previous dose. Recovery alone does not authorise a restart. Source: interrupt for 7 days or until ≤grade 2; clinician chooses 160, 120 or 80 mg/day. Do not restart with ongoing intolerable/severe toxicity."
      },
